# Entes EMK-01.
# Converted automatically from the Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST); see ATTRIBUTION.md.
# Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation.
# Corrections are welcome (CONTRIBUTING.md). Remove @x_status once this table has been checked against the manual.
# | Entes EMK-01 — Modbus register map for Omni Console
# | 
# | Source: Entes EMK-01 Register Table (embedded documentation, FC03 section)
# | - 4-phase (3-phase + N) power quality analyser, RS485 Modbus RTU.
# | - Holding registers (FC03/read, FC16/write).
# | - IEEE-754 float (32-bit, 2 registers) and long64 (64-bit, 4 registers), Big-Endian (MSW first).
# | - Protocol address = table address − 40001 (standard Modicon 4xxxx convention).
# | - Measurement block: table 40001–40425+ (protocol 0–424+).
# | - Energy block: float at table 55024–55034 (protocol 15023–15033).
# | - Factory defaults: slave=1, baud configurable (check unit).
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Entes
@model=EMK-01
@vendor_website=entes.com.tr
@description=4-phase power quality analyser — per-phase V/I/P/Q/S/CosPhi/PF, voltage & current THD, 3-/4-phase totals, frequency, temperature, energy (IEEE-754 float, Big-Endian).
@source=Omni Console device library (OmniCoreST), modbus-library/entes-emk01.toml; Source: Entes EMK-01 Register Table (embedded documentation, FC03 section). Not verified against the manufacturer's documentation
@byte_order=ABCD
@address_base=0
@x_status=unverified
@x_origin=omniconsole

